X:1
T:Take My Life And Let It Be
T:MOZART
C:Music: Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart (1756-1791) · Words: Frances R. Havergal, 1874
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: Hymnal and Liturgies of the Moravian Church, 1920 Hymn 471. setting very similar to "The Coronation Hymnal", American Baptist Publication Society, 1894 Hymn 182. The hymnary.org score found for comparison (hymnary.org/tune/nottingham_mozart) is a different tune or version, so the melody follows the Open Hymnal's source.
